// The workspace of the PACA monorepository.
//
// Every Go module of the tree is listed here, so the modules are built and
// tested against each other without a `replace` directive between them. A
// module keeps working on its own: `go build ./...` inside a module directory
// still resolves its own dependencies.
//
// The Go version is pinned here, and in every go.mod of the tree, so every
// contributor and every container compiles the same code with the same
// toolchain.
go 1.27.3

use (
	./apps/db-admin
	./apps/mcp-server
	./packages/core
	./packages/domain
	./tools
)
